== Description ==

'''Bearing''' is a crafted component in ''[[Human Host]]'', sourced from the world (loot, salvage, or base crafting). It appears as an ingredient in 9 downstream recipes at the [[Electronics Workbench]] and the [[Mechanical Workbench]], including [[Solar Generator]], [[Bicycle Generator]], [[Flexible Rotor]], [[Rotor]], [[Wheel]], [[Simple Generator]], among others. See the ''Used in'' table for the full consumer list.

